            <div class="lg:sticky lg:top-10">
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">
                    1. Launch in 10 Minutes
                </h3>
                <p class="mt-3 text-lg text-gray-500">
                    Setting up a school database used to take weeks. With our <strong>6-Step Wizard</strong>, you just click checkboxes. We auto-generate your Classes, Arms, and Fee Structure instantly.
                </p>
                <dl class="mt-10 space-y-6">
                    <div class="flex">
                        <div class="flex-shrink-0">
                            <div class="flex items-center justify-center h-12 w-12 rounded-md bg-blue-600 text-white">✓</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="ml-4">
                            <dt class="text-lg leading-6 font-medium text-gray-900">No IT Guy Needed</dt>
                            <dd class="mt-2 text-base text-gray-500">If you can use Facebook, you can set up Edus.</dd>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </dl>
            </div>
            
            <div class="mt-10 lg:mt-0 relative">
