            <div class="lg:order-2 lg:sticky lg:top-10">
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">
                    2. The Parent Experience
                </h3>
                <p class="mt-3 text-lg text-gray-500">
                    Give parents a modern portal. They can view all their children in one dashboard, check outstanding balances, and verify payment history without calling the school.
                </p>
