        <div class="lg:grid lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16 lg:items-start">
            <div class="lg:sticky lg:top-10">
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">
                    3. Smart Admission Engine
                </h3>
                <p class="mt-3 text-lg text-gray-500">
                    Enroll students in seconds. Our smart form checks for duplicate parents by phone number and links siblings automatically.
                </p>
                <dl class="mt-10 space-y-6">
                    <div class="flex">
                        <div class="flex-shrink-0">
                            <div class="flex items-center justify-center h-12 w-12 rounded-md bg-green-600 text-white">✓</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="ml-4">
                            <dt class="text-lg leading-6 font-medium text-gray-900">Auto-Invoicing</dt>
                            <dd class="mt-2 text-base text-gray-500">The moment you click "Admit", the system looks up the fee structure and generates the student's first bill instantly.</dd>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </dl>
            </div>
            
            <div class="mt-10 lg:mt-0 relative">
                <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-xl border-t-4 border-green-600">
